    "smalltalk"
  ],
  "level_notes": {
    "1": "No specification; the Scratch 3 VM (scratch-vm) is the de-facto definition. The project.json file-format wiki page and the designers' papers are the closest primary sources.",
    "0": "Scratch 3 is JavaScript (scratch-vm, scratch-blocks, scratch-gui); Scratch 1.x/2.0 were Squeak Smalltalk and Flash/ActionScript."
